amp remain unchanged."},{"requirement":"Installed OS release and kernel retained with compatible software","command_ids":["cmd-d1a3482198a7430e","cmd-89ef8d4478cc49c6","cmd-fdb0008182434401","cmd-177c56232028465d"],"summary":"Both nodes remain on CentOS Stream 10 with kernel 6.12.0-205.el10.x86_64; MariaDB 10.11 comes from the native AppStream repository."},{"requirement":"node1 restart and database recovery","command_ids":["cmd-25e26b152740465f","cmd-ebd97a5e804040f1","cmd-8e08827c3f684e45","cmd-fdb0008182434401"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot fb2aa416-d036-46d3-aeb8-30c65a01cb34, acknowledged native reboot, changed boot 9d30467c-c66b-43e6-8b18-96870b139351, active MariaDB, intact data, zero orphans, and unchanged export."},{"requirement":"node2 restart and reporting recovery","command_ids":["cmd-48b70709e00d4992","cmd-91a81e63cf844f9b","cmd-9558883c23614d3b","cmd-177c56232028465d"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot 32e1f4e0-0ae4-4b67-9b90-4ddc6c4ce51e, acknowledged native reboot, changed boot 4376da1a-b29a-436d-b6e4-051b72a42034, recovered mode-600 credentials, remote reads, exact values, and continuing write denial."}]}
